{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":361999,"duration_api_ms":597559,"num_turns":24,"result":"","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"a741f87c-ced6-4af7-8535-826da8ee1a88","total_cost_usd":1.3847571499999998,"usage":{"input_tokens":18,"cache_creation_input_tokens":61792,"cache_read_input_tokens":895935,"output_tokens":8711,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":61792,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":185,"outputTokens":13674,"cacheReadInputTokens":1328609,"cacheCreationInputTokens":105047,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.33272465000000007,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":18,"outputTokens":8711,"cacheReadInputTokens":895935,"cacheCreationInputTokens":61792,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":1.0520324999999997,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"structured_output":{"outcome":"approved","evidence":["All 6 conservation_regression tests pass on committed code: grazing, feeding, mortality_senescence, trim_and_remove, trim_and_leave, water_change (6 passed, 0 failed).","E2e conservation suite passes all 6 scenarios with correct delta magnitudes: closed-system scenarios show +0.000000000 drift; open-system scenarios show expected deltas (trim_and_remove: dN=-38.5, dC=-240.625; water_change: dN=+20.0, dC=+97.5).","Budget tracking tests: 24/24 pass on committed code. Budget helper tests: 13/13 pass.","cargo clippy -p tank_core -p tank_harness -- -D warnings passes cleanly.","cargo fmt --all --check passes on committed code.","All 6 tests have descriptive doc comments explaining the conservation story (verified in conservation_regression.rs lines 236-870).","TOL = 1e-6 is used consistently across all conservation assertions.","All tests enable Detail-verbosity tracing via engine.enable_tracing(SimTracer::new(Verbosity::Detail)).","All pathway assertions use assert_or_dump/assert_close_or_dump/assert_trace_delta helpers that dump traces to /tmp/tank_conservation_traces/ on failure.","E2e runner produces formatted ASCII summary table (pass/fail per scenario with dN/dC magnitudes) and exits non-zero on failure via assert_eq!(failed_count, 0, ...).","Export actions are tracked via is_open_system_action_label() covering feed, water_change, siphon_detritus, add/remove_shrimp, and trim_plants_and_remove.","Accepted final review amendments applied: default.toml now uses precise value 0.1427857499821518 for alkalinity_meq_per_mg_n_nitrified, presets.rs serde fallback uses NITRIFICATION_ALK_MEQ_PER_MG_N constant, budget_helpers.rs unit strings centralized via Element::unit() method.","Both N and C are checked in all 6 scenarios (12+ assertions total).","Water change test includes source nitrite in expected_n_import formula (conservation_regression.rs line 888)."],"findings_or_gaps":["test_weekly_trim_and_remove_exports_nutrients_over_500_hours in budget_tracking.rs does not zero DIC shortcut rates (unlike close_budget_gas_exchange). It currently passes because the committed ProcessParams::default() DIC rates are already non-zero and the test's budget tracking tolerates them. However, uncommitted parallel work (bead 6e5.4.7 photosynthesis DIC changes in algae_growth.rs/plant_growth.rs) breaks this test with a 52.5 mg carbon imbalance at tick 23. When that parallel work lands, this test will need its DIC shortcuts zeroed — the same pattern as the close_budget_gas_exchange fix from amendment fr-2-7a419098.","The water change e2e fixture does not set a non-zero source nitrite value (source.nitrite_mg_n_per_l defaults to 0.0 from SourceWaterProfile::zero()), so while the expected_n_import formula correctly includes the nitrite term, it is not actually exercised with a non-zero value. This is a minor coverage gap, not a correctness issue."],"follow_up_or_amendments":[]},"fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"2c647290-540f-4f71-a403-ab246b73fd69"}
